<title>SINGAPORE: Petron tenders to buy June loading Qatar Marine.</title>
<headline>Petron tenders to buy June loading Qatar Marine.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine oil refiner Petron closed an informal tender Thursday to buy a June-loading cargo of Qatar Marine crude, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender closed at 1500 hours (0700 GMT) Manila time and offers were made to be valid until the close of business on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>A Petron source said the refinery had sought selective sellers for the cargo, rather than issuing a public tender.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Petron tendered to buy Qatar Marine or Upper Zakum crude and awarded a Qatar Marine cargo.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
